{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Into the Canvas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and jump into this quirky co-op puzzle adventure where you play as Cat and Mouse, two unlikely partners who have fallen into a strange painted world. Your goal? Work together, dodge obstacles, and use a magical bucket of paint to uncover hidden paths and solve colorful challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is designed to spark laughter and teamwork\u2014whether you\u2019re timing jumps, splattering paint to reveal clues, or just causing silly chaos together. With its light-hearted style, simple controls, and focus on cooperation, this is a game meant to be enjoyed on the couch with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Into the Canvas was created as a summer project by Unconscious Studios, a small team of passionate students who wanted to bring playful creativity to life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005390?t=1758919215","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005390?t=1758919215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005390/077c1a60f66e27f9c07f13b69dd3f153b87cbb7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758919215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005390/077c1a60f66e27f9c07f13b69dd3f153b87cbb7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758919215","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Into the Canvas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and jump into this quirky co-op puzzle adventure where you play as Cat and Mouse, two unlikely partners who 